WEBVTT

00:34.680 --> 00:35.510
<b>Hello?</b>

00:35.720 --> 00:36.640
<b><i>Guess who.</i></b>

00:36.640 --> 00:40.140
<b>SQUEE</b>

00:38.390 --> 00:40.140
<b>Yeah, it's Eita.</b>

00:40.560 --> 00:41.810
<b><i>Are you busy now?</i></b>

00:42.310 --> 00:44.270
<b>I was adjusting my DPI.</b>

00:44.270 --> 00:46.690
<b>DPI = MOUSE SENSITIVITY</b>

00:44.730 --> 00:46.150
<b><i>Mr. Time-on-his-hands!</i></b>

00:47.860 --> 00:50.730
<b><i>Oh, hey, you're coming over today, right?</i></b>

00:50.730 --> 00:51.820
<b><i>To tutor Runa?</i></b>

00:52.360 --> 00:55.490
<b>Oh, so we're sticking
to the original schedule?</b>

00:55.490 --> 00:57.360
<b>Huh? Aren't you?</b>

00:55.490 --> 01:02.370
<b>MASHIRO-YA</b>

00:57.950 --> 01:01.410
<b>So listen, can you bring over
that manga I mentioned?</b>

01:01.410 --> 01:02.370
<b>I want to read it!</b>

01:02.750 --> 01:03.580
<b><i>Sure thing.</i></b>

01:03.580 --> 01:06.000
<b>Yay! I love you, Yamada!</b>

01:07.630 --> 01:09.630
<b>Okay. I'll see you later, then.</b>

01:13.170 --> 01:14.420
<b><i>Okay!</i></b>

01:14.420 --> 01:18.180
<b><i>Sure. Next Saturday, right?
Yes, sounds good!</i></b>

01:18.470 --> 01:20.760
<b><i>I'm going to hang out with Runa!</i></b>

01:21.010 --> 01:22.430
<b><i>...this makes me happy!</i></b>

01:23.270 --> 01:25.480
<b>OCTOBER 3 (SAT)</b>

03:00.200 --> 03:01.030
<b>Well...</b>

03:02.030 --> 03:03.740
<b>I must say, it never occurred to me</b>

03:03.740 --> 03:08.040
<b>that Lady Rurihime was such
a lovely young woman in real life.</b>

03:08.700 --> 03:13.790
<b>My experience told me that she
absolutely 100% had to be a man.</b>

03:14.880 --> 03:18.170
<b>Not that I would be deterred
from loving her, of course.</b>

03:18.170 --> 03:20.970
<b>But who knew that she'd turn out
to be an actual youthful woman?</b>

03:22.010 --> 03:24.260
<b>My insights are apparently too shallow.</b>

03:27.970 --> 03:33.560
<b>Um, I think I've said this numerous times,
but I'm not Rurihime.</b>

03:32.270 --> 03:36.900
<b>Either way, I never dreamed that I'd
one day get the chance to meet you.</b>

03:36.900 --> 03:39.820
<b>When I heard that you were playing
as Rurihime again in FOS,</b>

03:39.820 --> 03:42.240
<b>I couldn't follow you fast enough
from my previous game,</b>

03:42.240 --> 03:44.070
<b>but I didn't think you'd recognize me.</b>

03:44.530 --> 03:47.410
<b>Not only are you adorable,
but in every game you play,</b>

03:47.410 --> 03:49.330
<b>you waste no time
making a name for yourself,</b>

03:49.330 --> 03:51.460
<b>which I believe makes
Lady Rurihime who she is,</b>

03:49.330 --> 03:53.580
<b>Something came up, so I'll be late.
My online gamer friend should be there,
so please start without me.
Sorry. Runa</b>

03:51.460 --> 03:53.580
<b>and as a fan, that makes me proud.</b>

03:54.580 --> 03:56.590
<b>PLEASE START WITHOUT ME</b>

03:57.000 --> 04:00.010
<b>Who would have thought it would
actually come to pass in this fashion?</b>

04:00.670 --> 04:05.850
<b>If you don't mind, I'd like to ask your
permission to join your guild as well.</b>

04:02.010 --> 04:04.340
<b>Um...</b>

04:06.260 --> 04:08.470
<b>I'm sorry! I need to go
to the ladies' room!</b>

04:09.270 --> 04:10.560
<b>Understood.</b>

04:13.560 --> 04:16.810
<b>Episode 5
How About You Give Us
an Explanation</b>

04:22.190 --> 04:23.860
<b><i>What's going on here?</i></b>

04:27.320 --> 04:28.620
<b><i>Runa's not here.</i></b>

04:30.740 --> 04:33.660
<b><i>And some guy I don't know
shows up at our meeting spot.</i></b>

04:34.330 --> 04:37.130
<b>Lady Rurihime! You're in there,
aren't you, Lady Rurihime?</b>

04:37.380 --> 04:40.960
<b>Lady Rurihime, Lady Rurihime,
Lady Rurihime, Lady Rurihime,</b>

04:37.750 --> 04:40.460
<b><i>And he's convinced that I'm Rurihime!</i></b>

04:40.710 --> 04:43.130
<b><i>But he's not listening to a word I say!</i></b>

04:40.960 --> 04:43.630
<b>Lady Rurihime, Lady Rurihime,
Lady Rurihime...</b>

04:52.390 --> 04:53.230
<b><i>Coming!</i></b>

04:53.770 --> 05:01.360
<b>SASAKI</b>

04:54.940 --> 04:56.770
<b>Thanks for coming, Yamada!</b>

04:56.770 --> 04:57.730
<b>Hello.</b>

04:57.730 --> 04:59.770
<b>You're as handsome as ever!</b>

05:01.730 --> 05:05.110
<b>All Runa does is hole up in her room,
playing games.</b>

05:05.110 --> 05:09.240
<b>With an attitude like that, do you think
she can get into your high school?</b>

05:11.740 --> 05:15.250
<b>Runa! Yamada's here to tutor you!</b>

05:15.410 --> 05:16.540
<b>Yamada!</b>

05:17.710 --> 05:18.670
<b>Hello.</b>

05:18.670 --> 05:21.090
<b>All right, I'll leave you to it!</b>

05:21.090 --> 05:21.920
<b>Okay.</b>

05:21.920 --> 05:23.630
<b>Make sure you take this seriously!</b>

05:23.630 --> 05:24.760
<b>I am, okay?</b>

05:28.220 --> 05:30.890
<b>I've done all the drills you assigned.</b>

05:31.600 --> 05:32.430
<b>See?</b>

05:31.930 --> 05:34.390
<b>PRAISE ME
PRAISE ME</b>

05:32.930 --> 05:34.390
<b>Runa, about today...</b>

05:34.680 --> 05:35.520
<b>Huh?</b>

05:36.390 --> 05:38.600
<b>Didn't you have somewhere to be?</b>

05:39.520 --> 05:41.070
<b>Wh-Why do you ask?</b>

05:46.740 --> 05:49.320
<b>Well, as long as you don't, it's fine.</b>

05:53.450 --> 05:55.450
<b>AKANE</b>

05:57.580 --> 06:00.170
<b>I don't have any other plans.</b>

06:02.670 --> 06:05.670
<b>RUNA SASAKI</b>

06:08.220 --> 06:10.260
<b><i>So Runa's not picking up.</i></b>

06:12.930 --> 06:14.220
<b>Oh, boy.</b>

06:14.770 --> 06:16.140
<b><i>What am I going to do?</i></b>

06:18.060 --> 06:20.770
<b><i>Stuck here with a stranger, huh?</i></b>

06:23.150 --> 06:24.940
<b>Excuse me? Lady Rurihime?</b>

06:26.280 --> 06:27.150
<b>Huh?</b>

06:27.150 --> 06:27.990
<b>What?</b>

06:29.950 --> 06:31.030
<b>What?</b>

06:32.160 --> 06:35.740
<b>Sorry to intrude, but you're in there,
correct, Lady Rurihime?</b>

06:37.660 --> 06:40.830
<b><i>Isn't this the ladies' room?
Are you kidding me?</i></b>

06:41.880 --> 06:43.920
<b>Lady Rurihime, are you all right?</b>

06:44.880 --> 06:49.720
<b>Um, I kind of have a stomachache.</b>

06:50.300 --> 06:53.010
<b>Aside from that,
this is the ladies' room, right?</b>

06:52.340 --> 06:55.350
<b>Ah, I knew it! That's what I thought!</b>

06:54.510 --> 06:55.510
<b>Um...</b>

06:55.350 --> 06:57.180
<b>Since you were taking so long to get back,</b>

06:56.680 --> 06:59.520
<b>this is, uh...</b>

06:57.180 --> 07:00.020
<b>I was afraid
you'd passed out in the restroom.</b>

07:00.850 --> 07:04.190
<b>Excuse me!
I'm pretty sure this is the ladies' room!</b>

07:09.450 --> 07:13.620
<b>Lady Rurihime, could I trouble you
to open this door, perhaps?</b>

07:14.740 --> 07:16.540
<b>Would you be so kind as to open the door?</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:19.040
<b>Lady Rurihime...</b>

07:21.420 --> 07:22.250
<b>It's not like...</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:25.000
<b>not like it's any big deal.</b>

07:25.000 --> 07:26.880
<b>And she might have left by now.</b>

07:27.920 --> 07:30.630
<b>In other words, you stood her up?</b>

07:31.050 --> 07:32.890
<b>I didn't stand her up.</b>

07:32.890 --> 07:35.970
<b>I had a gamer friend go in my place.</b>

07:36.470 --> 07:37.640
<b>Gamer friend?</b>

07:38.220 --> 07:41.060
<b>This guy who's a rabid fan
of my brother's character.</b>

07:41.560 --> 07:43.480
<b>When I invited him
through Brother's account,</b>

07:43.480 --> 07:45.230
<b>he was beside himself with joy.</b>

07:48.730 --> 07:50.400
<b>Yamada, where are you going?</b>

07:50.400 --> 07:52.200
<b>Where did you ask her to meet you?</b>

07:52.200 --> 07:53.160
<b>But why?</b>

07:53.570 --> 07:55.030
<b>You're asking why?</b>

07:55.030 --> 07:56.530
<b>How dangerous do you think this is?</b>

07:56.530 --> 07:57.790
<b>I'm going to go check on her.</b>

07:57.790 --> 07:59.160
<b>What about my session?</b>

07:59.160 --> 08:01.330
<b>I'll be right back,
so work on your drills.</b>

08:01.330 --> 08:02.160
<b>Come back!</b>

08:04.920 --> 08:06.000
<b>What a surprise.</b>

08:07.420 --> 08:11.550
<b>I BROUGHT YOU SOME SNACKS</b>

08:07.670 --> 08:09.550
<b>I thought we had an automatic door!</b>

08:10.510 --> 08:11.550
<b>Eita...</b>

08:19.220 --> 08:20.220
<b>What's wrong?</b>

08:24.980 --> 08:28.650
<b>Whoa, you really did message him
from my account!</b>

08:29.020 --> 08:30.860
<b>This is beyond heinous.</b>

08:30.860 --> 08:32.280
<b>Where are they meeting?</b>

08:36.620 --> 08:37.870
<b>Let's see.</b>

08:37.870 --> 08:40.200
<b>Hey, it's fairly close by.</b>

08:40.200 --> 08:42.960
<b>Maybe 15 minutes or so from here by car?</b>

08:56.550 --> 08:57.680
<b><i>Why?</i></b>

08:58.680 --> 08:59.510
<b><i>Runa...</i></b>

09:04.020 --> 09:04.980
<b><i>Runa...</i></b>

09:08.900 --> 09:12.860
<b><i>Hey, Runa! What do you want to do today?</i></b>

09:16.860 --> 09:19.580
<b><i>Why can't things stay the way they are?</i></b>

09:29.960 --> 09:34.720
<b>Oh, no! Akane's been kidnapped
by antisocial forces with scars!</b>

09:34.720 --> 09:35.930
<b>Is that true?</b>

09:36.470 --> 09:38.930
<b>Oh, dear! Agane! Agane...</b>

09:41.890 --> 09:43.930
<b>I may have embellished the story a tad!</b>

09:45.430 --> 09:53.650
<b>Akane!</b>

09:48.690 --> 09:50.650
<b>Thanks for driving us, Mr. Kamota!</b>

09:51.650 --> 09:54.190
<b>Mr. Kamota, you were supposed
to take a right at the light.</b>

09:54.190 --> 09:55.900
<b>PROTECTION CHARM FOR SAFE DRIVING</b>

09:59.240 --> 10:01.330
<b>Mr. Kamota, we're moving away.</b>

10:05.540 --> 10:08.120
<b>You have to apologize to Akanecchi
when you see her—</b>

10:08.120 --> 10:09.040
<b>I'm not apologizing!</b>

10:11.460 --> 10:16.220
<b>Enough is enough. This is exactly
why people don't like you at school.</b>

10:17.050 --> 10:18.430
<b>Who cares?</b>

10:18.970 --> 10:21.430
<b>I've got 300 friends online.</b>

10:21.430 --> 10:25.100
<b>Oh, Akane!
What are we going to do, Yamada?</b>

10:25.100 --> 10:27.060
<b>Mr. Kamota, keep your eyes on the road.</b>

10:31.560 --> 10:34.400
<b>Everyone's always going, "Akane, Akane..."
It's so stupid!</b>

10:35.570 --> 10:39.320
<b>In the first place, why did you let her
into the guild without my permission?</b>

10:39.820 --> 10:40.820
<b>Listen up.</b>

10:40.820 --> 10:41.820
<b>IT'S MY GUILD...</b>

10:42.660 --> 10:45.410
<b>Know what happens when the old-timers
remove the newbies?</b>

10:45.410 --> 10:47.660
<b>The content gets staler and staler.</b>

10:48.210 --> 10:49.750
<b>Be more generous.</b>

10:50.460 --> 10:51.460
<b>What's up with that?</b>

10:54.590 --> 10:57.970
<b>She tried to be your friend, didn't she?</b>

11:01.550 --> 11:03.390
<b><i>Next Saturday, right?</i></b>

11:04.510 --> 11:05.850
<b><i>Yes, sounds good!</i></b>

11:16.110 --> 11:18.320
<b>All righty, how about we split up
and search for her?</b>

11:18.320 --> 11:20.860
<b>Akane! Akane!</b>

11:20.860 --> 11:22.620
<b>Mr. Kamota, you're heavy.</b>

11:22.620 --> 11:24.990
<b>Where? Where? Where? Where?
Where? Where? Where? Where?</b>

11:24.990 --> 11:26.290
<b>Hey, there she is.</b>

11:26.290 --> 11:28.200
<b>So fast! I can't believe you spotted her.</b>

11:29.660 --> 11:30.580
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:32.420 --> 11:33.920
<b>But she...</b>

11:35.340 --> 11:36.300
<b>seems a little...</b>

11:40.090 --> 11:40.930
<b>Aka—</b>

11:42.010 --> 11:43.970
<b>Akane!</b>

11:47.890 --> 11:48.720
<b>Huh?</b>

11:48.720 --> 11:51.600
<b>Akane! Akane!
I'm so relieved that you're okay!</b>

11:51.600 --> 11:52.810
<b>Mr. Kamota?</b>

11:53.650 --> 11:57.110
<b>You're safe now!
Now let the grownup take it from here!</b>

11:59.690 --> 12:01.070
<b>And who might you be?</b>

12:01.070 --> 12:04.950
<b>I'm Takezo Kamota, the owner
of the Kamota Strawberry Farm!</b>

12:04.950 --> 12:07.370
<b>I have a lawyer friend,
I'll have you know!</b>

12:07.700 --> 12:10.660
<b>I won't back down
before violence or threats!</b>

12:10.660 --> 12:12.620
<b>Let's battle this out in court!</b>

12:14.790 --> 12:16.210
<b>Are you okay, Akanecchi?</b>

12:18.170 --> 12:20.710
<b>Eita! And Yamada too?</b>

12:21.220 --> 12:22.930
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

12:22.930 --> 12:25.220
<b>We heard that Runa invited some stranger.</b>

12:25.220 --> 12:27.050
<b>We were worried
and came to check on you.</b>

12:29.010 --> 12:30.850
<b>Your leg. What happened?</b>

12:31.350 --> 12:33.940
<b>Oh... this?</b>

12:34.230 --> 12:35.860
<b>Forgive me. I'm to blame.</b>

12:36.690 --> 12:39.480
<b>Because I startled her
in the ladies' room.</b>

12:39.940 --> 12:42.070
<b>How about you give us an explanation?</b>

12:42.070 --> 12:42.950
<b>Personal space.</b>

12:46.370 --> 12:49.740
<b>Fearing that Lady Rurihime
might have fainted in the ladies' room,</b>

12:49.740 --> 12:52.120
<b>I thought I'd bring her some medicine.</b>

12:57.290 --> 13:00.250
<b>Lady Rurihime,
are you unable to open the door?</b>

13:01.340 --> 13:02.260
<b>In that case...</b>

13:03.130 --> 13:04.800
<b>Excuse me for sliding it under the door.</b>

13:04.800 --> 13:05.510
<b>PAIN RELIEVER</b>

13:06.890 --> 13:07.720
<b>Huh?</b>

13:10.430 --> 13:11.970
<b>Ow...</b>

13:11.970 --> 13:13.020
<b>Lady Rurihime?</b>

13:13.640 --> 13:14.690
<b>Lady Rurihime?</b>

13:14.690 --> 13:18.060
<b>SEVERE PAIN</b>

13:15.690 --> 13:16.190
<b>PAIN RELIEVER</b>

13:16.850 --> 13:18.060
<b>In this way...</b>

13:18.360 --> 13:22.650
<b>after receiving an excessive shock,
she slammed her shin against the toilet.</b>

13:23.400 --> 13:25.820
<b>Who wouldn't have been shocked
out of their mind by that?</b>

13:23.400 --> 13:25.820
<b>AND IT'S STILL KILLING ME NOW!!</b>

13:26.410 --> 13:28.780
<b>How strange.
When a woman seems indisposed</b>

13:28.780 --> 13:30.330
<b>and shuts herself in the restroom,</b>

13:30.330 --> 13:32.160
<b>one must silently
offer her pain relievers,</b>

13:32.160 --> 13:33.450
<b>or so I was told by my mother.</b>

13:33.790 --> 13:35.830
<b>Don't act on half-baked knowledge like that!</b>

13:36.370 --> 13:38.170
<b>First, don't barge into the ladies' room!</b>

13:39.250 --> 13:41.170
<b>You are extremely rude, do you know that?</b>

13:41.170 --> 13:43.840
<b>Who are you to Rurihime, exactly?</b>

13:43.840 --> 13:45.300
<b>Not something I want to tell you.</b>

13:46.510 --> 13:48.550
<b><i>Just do whatever you want.</i></b>

13:54.270 --> 13:55.100
<b>Hey!</b>

13:57.310 --> 13:59.690
<b>I hear you were worried
and came to check on me?</b>

13:59.980 --> 14:00.940
<b>Thanks for doing that.</b>

14:01.770 --> 14:03.480
<b>No... I'm sorry.</b>

14:03.980 --> 14:04.820
<b>Huh?</b>

14:05.150 --> 14:07.360
<b>Why are you apologizing, Yamada?</b>

14:07.360 --> 14:11.200
<b>Well, if I'd told you that I
would be tutoring Runa today...</b>

14:11.700 --> 14:14.160
<b>So you're Runa's tutor, Yamada?</b>

14:14.660 --> 14:15.500
<b>Yes.</b>

14:15.500 --> 14:19.420
<b>Oh, I see! So that's why Runa
couldn't make it today.</b>

14:19.420 --> 14:20.460
<b>Actually...</b>

14:20.460 --> 14:22.500
<b>- I don't know about that.
- So that was it!</b>

14:56.870 --> 14:57.710
<b>Huh?</b>

14:58.250 --> 14:59.160
<b>Runa?</b>

15:00.000 --> 15:00.830
<b>Runa!</b>

15:01.920 --> 15:03.670
<b>AGAIN...</b>

15:04.130 --> 15:05.340
<b>Ow!</b>

15:21.440 --> 15:22.400
<b>Huh?</b>

15:24.360 --> 15:25.940
<b>Did you hurt yourself?</b>

15:28.900 --> 15:29.780
<b>What?</b>

15:31.450 --> 15:32.280
<b>I'm sor—</b>

15:32.280 --> 15:33.120
<b>Runa...</b>

15:36.790 --> 15:37.620
<b>come with me.</b>

15:38.080 --> 15:39.120
<b>You're in for a lecture.</b>

15:44.670 --> 15:45.880
<b>I'm not saving you.</b>

15:46.460 --> 15:48.630
<b>That was a really dangerous prank
that you pulled.</b>

15:48.630 --> 15:50.220
<b>You need to think about what you did.</b>

15:51.680 --> 15:52.510
<b>Come on.</b>

15:59.850 --> 16:03.770
<b>Ow! Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch!</b>

16:04.190 --> 16:05.060
<b>Akanecchi?</b>

16:05.560 --> 16:07.440
<b>All of a sudden, my stomach hurts!</b>

16:07.440 --> 16:09.280
<b>Stomach? Not your leg?</b>

16:09.610 --> 16:12.070
<b>Huh? Oh, uh, yeah.</b>

16:12.070 --> 16:15.280
<b>It's like the pain shifted to my stomach.</b>

16:16.580 --> 16:20.290
<b>Perhaps it would help to take
the medication that I gave you earlier?</b>

16:20.290 --> 16:23.210
<b>Look, you, don't even think
about talking to Akane!</b>

16:23.210 --> 16:24.540
<b>So he's still here.</b>

16:24.580 --> 16:29.170
<b>UGH...</b>

16:25.580 --> 16:29.170
<b>Those are useless. They'd have no effect.</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:33.010
<b>Only Category-1 OTC pain relievers
dispensed by a pharmacist</b>

16:33.010 --> 16:34.930
<b>would work on this pain.</b>

16:34.930 --> 16:36.800
<b>Category-1, huh?</b>

16:36.930 --> 16:39.560
<b>If you walk towards the station
about 500 meters,</b>

16:39.560 --> 16:41.350
<b>there's a drugstore to the right.</b>

16:41.350 --> 16:43.350
<b>Uh, right! I'll head over right now!</b>

16:43.350 --> 16:44.560
<b>No, I'll go!</b>

16:47.610 --> 16:49.530
<b>Rub my stomach, will you?</b>

16:50.780 --> 16:53.820
<b>Oh, and since I'd worry about Eita
going shopping on his own...</b>

16:53.820 --> 16:56.200
<b>Yamada and Mr. Kamota,
could you please go with him?</b>

16:56.200 --> 16:58.200
<b>As for you, please take a hike!</b>

17:37.360 --> 17:39.240
<b>So, Runa, what level are you?</b>

17:42.540 --> 17:43.500
<b>What?</b>

17:43.500 --> 17:45.960
<b>Oh, sorry, I was talking about FOS.</b>

17:46.620 --> 17:50.250
<b>Um, two are max level,
and the others, I don't keep track of.</b>

17:50.670 --> 17:54.470
<b>What? Then I guess we can't
go hunting together, can we?</b>

17:54.470 --> 17:56.430
<b>Since my level's too low.</b>

17:57.180 --> 17:59.510
<b>We can't if the level difference
is too great, right?</b>

17:59.510 --> 18:02.310
<b>I asked Yamada once,
and he turned me down!</b>

18:02.310 --> 18:04.230
<b><i>Hunt together?</i></b>

18:04.230 --> 18:06.640
<b><i>There's too much
of a level difference, so...</i></b>

18:06.640 --> 18:08.770
<b><i>it's not worth the XP penalty.</i></b>

18:09.560 --> 18:11.820
<b>That wouldn't really bother me.</b>

18:11.820 --> 18:14.570
<b>And I've got
a low-level character too, so...</b>

18:16.530 --> 18:18.780
<b>Then let's go hunting together sometime!</b>

18:19.780 --> 18:22.540
<b>My Job Class is Paladin,
but Runa, are you—</b>

18:22.540 --> 18:24.790
<b>How can you talk like nothing happened?</b>

18:25.120 --> 18:27.830
<b>You didn't think it was weird,
getting stood up?</b>

18:28.120 --> 18:30.210
<b>Uh, um...</b>

18:32.500 --> 18:34.210
<b>I ditched you on purpose!</b>

18:34.210 --> 18:35.800
<b>I wanted to put you on the spot!</b>

18:35.800 --> 18:38.050
<b>Because I don't like you, Akane!</b>

18:38.550 --> 18:40.470
<b>I wanted you to leave the guild!</b>

18:41.430 --> 18:45.310
<b>I thought if I sent over someone weird,
you wouldn't like online games anymore!</b>

18:46.680 --> 18:49.270
<b>Well, I did think it was kind of strange.</b>

18:50.350 --> 18:52.110
<b>AH, I SEE....</b>

18:57.570 --> 18:59.450
<b><i>Did you hurt yourself?</i></b>

19:08.040 --> 19:11.330
<b>I think I'll leave the lecturing
to your brother.</b>

19:14.800 --> 19:18.340
<b>After all, I came here today
to get closer to you.</b>

19:21.340 --> 19:23.140
<b>You guys are all such great people...</b>

19:23.800 --> 19:28.020
<b>so these days, I've been so happy
that I got to join this guild.</b>

19:28.850 --> 19:31.690
<b>But I know that they're
your precious friends, right, Runa?</b>

19:34.320 --> 19:39.610
<b>So today I came to ask you
to let me in, too. Into your circle!</b>

20:04.010 --> 20:05.300
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

20:08.810 --> 20:11.810
<b>I'm sorry I was mean to you!</b>

20:23.780 --> 20:26.780
<b>Adolescent girls sure are a handful, huh?</b>

20:26.780 --> 20:31.790
<b>MEDICINE</b>

20:27.790 --> 20:31.790
<b>Who would have thought
she'd lash out so hard at Akane?</b>

20:32.000 --> 20:34.250
<b>Really, I'm at the end of my rope!</b>

20:34.250 --> 20:37.210
<b>To think she was
so obedient and cute as a child.</b>

20:38.300 --> 20:40.420
<b>I don't know
what I'm going to do with her.</b>

20:59.480 --> 21:00.690
<b>Welcome back!</b>

21:02.400 --> 21:03.360
<b>Hey!</b>

21:04.280 --> 21:07.160
<b>Is your stomach okay now, Akane?</b>

21:07.160 --> 21:10.580
<b>What? Oh, right! Yes, all better now!</b>

21:11.200 --> 21:13.410
<b>I guess because Runa rubbed it for me?</b>

22:53.010 --> 22:54.350
<b>That was some disaster, right?</b>

22:54.770 --> 22:55.640
<b>Huh?</b>

22:55.930 --> 22:59.770
<b>You were looking forward to today,
only to get pranked by Runa.</b>

23:00.270 --> 23:01.650
<b>Oh, that.</b>

23:02.060 --> 23:07.240
<b>Well, I could have just turned around and
gone home when I saw a stranger here.</b>

23:07.740 --> 23:10.030
<b>Sure, it did tick me off a little,</b>

23:10.030 --> 23:13.280
<b>but I was more disappointed
that we just didn't get to hang out.</b>

23:15.370 --> 23:17.040
<b>Yeah, but just watch me!</b>

23:17.540 --> 23:19.580
<b>I may be hopeless at romance...</b>

23:20.120 --> 23:23.840
<b>but I'm pretty good
at making friends with other girls!</b>

23:24.590 --> 23:27.590
<b>So I bet I can get closer to her
one of these days!</b>

23:29.590 --> 23:30.970
<b>That's my Lady Rurihime!</b>

23:30.970 --> 23:31.800
<b>Whoa!</b>

23:31.800 --> 23:34.600
<b>Your kindness is as rumored!
It is truly that of a Muse!</b>

23:32.470 --> 23:34.220
<b>YOU'RE STILL HERE</b>

23:35.140 --> 23:37.470
<b>Please go out with me
with marriage in mind!</b>

23:37.470 --> 23:38.930
<b>Please go home!</b>
